<!--
    properties.xml — MTT Real Estate Catalog
    Loaded by core/systems/realestate/realestate.py

    Each <property> is a purchasable or rentable listing.
    - type: house | apartment | vacant_land | business | commercial | farm
    - agent_id: references data/realestate_agents.xml <agent id="">
    - for_sale / for_rent flags control Buy vs Rent availability
    - price = purchase price, rent_price = per-period rent (weekly)
    - <stats> holds extensible property stats: beds, baths, parking, garage_spaces,
      land_sqm, land_acres, floors, year_built, condition, vacant (bool), etc.
      New stats can be added without code changes — they are passed as dict.

    Parking/Garage:
      parking = outdoor parking spaces
      garage_spaces = enclosed garage spaces
      total vehicle capacity = parking + garage_spaces

    Vacant blocks set <vacant>true</vacant> and typically have beds=0, parking=0-2.

    Future businesses will reuse this file with type="business" and extra stats like
    income_per_day, staff_slots, etc.
-->
